# The DESTRUCTIVE repository-to-database reset, generated only by
# `npm run content:export -- --sql --force`. Never committed: a file in the
# repository named like the seed is a file somebody will eventually paste into
# a SQL editor by mistake, and this one replaces the live site content.
supabase/seed/*.reset.sql

# The original phone footage the mobile hero loop is encoded from. It is a
